  "gameDescriptionHtml": "\nA psychological horror set in a Lovecraftian setting, blending with the cold reality of a military submarine trapped in the depths of the North Atlantic. This story follows ordinary people pushed to the brink of madness as they encounter the unthinkable horrors beneath the waves.<p></p>\n<p><b>LOVECRAFTIAN HORROR</b><br>\nAncient forces have awakened beneath the ocean, and all contact with the surface is lost. Seek answers at the heart of an apocalypse aboard a nuclear submarine.</p>\n<p><b>MAKE HARD CHOICES</b><br>\nEvery crew member is more than just an asset. They are human beings, haunted by their own fears and suffering. You have to make hard choice – complete the mission or preserve your humanity.</p>\n<p><b>YOU ARE IN CHARGE NOW</b></p>\n<p>You are the captain’s right hand. Assign tasks, maintain discipline, and don’t let madness overcome your mind.</p>\n<p><b>LOOK INTO THE ABYSS</b><br>\nScan the depths with sonar. But remember, not everything in the ocean follows military protocol… Is it another submarine, or something alive?<br>\n</p>",
